+## 🛠️ Tech Stack
+
+- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
+- **Language**: TypeScript
+- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
+- **State Management**: Zustand
+- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui with Radix UI
